            "damageType": "bludgeoning"
          }
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>用臃肿身躯撞开敌人。命中时可推开 5 尺（若目标成功 @Check[fortitude|dc:20] 则不被推开）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
