    },
    {
      "_id": "whbMthBlind00001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "几乎失明",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>肉头怪没有头颅，也没有精密视觉。它<strong>免疫目盲</strong>带来的额外惩罚（本就近乎目盲），但对视觉效果（如幻术）通常无效或由 GM 裁定。</p>\n<p>感知主要依赖听觉（不精确，30 尺）与水蛭的粗糙反馈：若有己方水蛭能感知到某生物（见水蛭「有限视力」），肉头怪将该生物视为处于<strong>隐蔽</strong>（攻击前通常需 @Check[flat|dc:5]，除非毒素感知生效）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbMthToxinSen01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "毒素感知",
      "sort": 510000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>肉头怪能「闻」到毒素。对下列生物，它在 <strong>60 尺</strong>内拥有<strong>不精确</strong>感知，在 <strong>30 尺</strong>内视为拥有足够信息直接打击（无需因隐蔽做 DC 5 持平检定）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带有 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntPsnFx0001]{猎杀中毒}；</li>\n<li>正受到<strong>毒素</strong>伤害或<strong>持续毒素</strong>伤害；</li>\n<li>带有毒类条件（如恶心且来源为毒素，GM 裁定）；</li>\n<li>上一轮曾受到毒素伤害。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对中毒猎人，肉头怪会优先追击。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbMthLeechGd001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "水蛭护卫",
      "sort": 520000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>遭遇开始时，肉头怪身边通常有 <strong>4</strong> 只 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-actors.Actor.whbHuntLeech0001]{腐沼水蛭}（散布在周围约 15 尺内）。场上己方水蛭同时最多 <strong>4</strong> 只。</p>\n<p>水蛭被杀后，肉头怪会再生成新的（见「滋生水蛭」）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbMthSpawnLch01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "滋生水蛭",
      "sort": 600000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 2 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>从颈腔与身上的蛭巢挤出新虫。在邻接空格生成 1 只 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-actors.Actor.whbHuntLeech0001]{腐沼水蛭}。若场上已有 4 只己方水蛭，则此动作无效。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbMthReacLch001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp",
      "name": "蛭巢反哺",
      "sort": 700000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "reaction" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 30 尺内一只己方腐沼水蛭被降至 0 HP</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 立刻在该水蛭原位置或邻接空格生成 1 只新的腐沼水蛭（仍受场上最多 4 只限制）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbMthDeathTrp01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "特性残渣（死亡）",
      "sort": 800000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>肉头怪死亡时掉落一枚<strong>随机特性残渣</strong>（Trait Spur）。掷 1d8，或由 GM 自选等价奖励：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>获得临时 HP 等于等级×2，持续 10 分钟</li>\n<li>下次打击额外 +1d6 精密伤害（一次）</li>\n<li>获得抵抗毒素 5，持续 1 小时</li>\n<li>恢复 2d8 HP</li>\n<li>速度 +5 尺，持续 10 分钟</li>\n<li>下一次豁免获得 +2 环境加值</li>\n<li>获得 1 点英雄点（若桌规不允许，改为恢复 4d8 HP）</li>\n<li>稀有：选择以上任意两项</li>\n</ol>\n<p><em>猎杀原作：必掉随机猎人特性。台上可换成一次性强力增益，或允许学习一个≤3 级相关专长（需正常代价，GM 裁定）。</em></p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    }
